                "type": "text",
                "title": "Verify exact references",
                "text": "Transform the Box: the object-local Note should stay current. Change its shape or topology: the face Note should report stale. Remove the source: both Notes should report detached. Save and reopen the Project to confirm the exact IDs persist."
